# Secrets — CHI TEN BIEN, KHONG GIA TRI THAT.
# Copy file nay thanh `.dev.vars` (da bi .gitignore chan) roi dien
# gia tri that de chay `wrangler dev` local. KHONG commit `.dev.vars`.
# Tren Cloudflare, set bang `wrangler secret put <TEN>` (xem README.md).
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
APPS_SCRIPT_URL=
# Tuy chon — chi khi da co Turnstile site key + secret:
# TURNSTILE_SECRET=
# Email (Resend) — CHI o server, khong commit gia tri that.
# Domain gui CHUA xac minh DNS (SPF/DKIM/DMARC) — xem src/email/README.md.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=
# RESEND_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# ADMIN_NOTIFY_EMAIL=visfaracademy@gmail.com
# UNSUBSCRIBE_SECRET=  # Ky token huy dang ky email (TASK 11) — secret rieng, khong dung chung RESEND_API_KEY.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://visfaracademy.netlify.app,http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:3100
# SePay — CHI khi SePay duoc phe duyet trien khai (QĐ 15). Khong co
# SEPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET thi moi webhook SePay bi tu choi 401.
# SEPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=<redacted>
# SEPAY_API_TOKEN=<redacted>
# SEPAY_BANK_ACCOUNT_ID=<redacted>
# SEPAY_MERCHANT_ID=<redacted>
